Package: windCleanHybrid
Type: Package
Title: Hybrid Model for Cleaning Abnormal Wind Turbine Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Diogo", "Ribeiro", email = "diogo_dj@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Professional implementation of a hybrid model combining Fuzzy C-Means clustering,
    Mahalanobis distance, and Artificial Neural Networks for detecting and removing outliers in
    wind turbine SCADA data, with full validation, documentation, and error handling.
